  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are a shaman of the machine world - you touch the Wired directly, through living <strong>Resonance</strong>, with no deck and no rig between you and the net. Your power flows from a bond with <strong>sprites</strong>: living code-spirits conjured out of the net itself, a congregation that acts as your board presence and your damage. The corp records call it a mental-health flag; the street calls you a <strong>Technomancer</strong>, ghost-shaman of the machine world.</p><p>Your engine is <strong>Resonance</strong>: communion with machine-spirits, deepening as your congregation of sprites grows and works. At the start of each of your turns, gain Resonance for each sprite currently compiled and under your command (up to a cap). Compiling a <strong>new</strong> sprite banks compile momentum (+2); the first time each round one of your sprites lands an effect, bank a harmonic echo (+1). You spend Resonance on heroic abilities and on compiling/sustaining sprites. Unspent Resonance is lost at the end of the encounter, and any sprites still compiled decompile.</p><h3>Signatures &amp; Subclass</h3><p>Three signatures cost no Resonance: <strong>Compile Sprite</strong> (call and command your congregation), <strong>Resonance Strike</strong> (your core attack, Cognition Power Roll), and <strong>Resonance Mending</strong> (the unique niche - the only healing in the game that works on machines, drones, chrome, and Cyborgs). At Tier 5 you choose a subclass - Sprite-Weaver, Machine-Whisperer, or Resonance-Warrior - that colors your congregation and grants an identity feature.</p><h3>Kit &amp; Chrome</h3><p>Half-caster with light chrome tolerance - techno-magic is friendlier to hardware than blood-magic, but the Sprite-Weaver stays nearly pure (deepest Resonance).</p><h3>Advancement (internal Level 1-5 = player-facing Tier 5-1)</h3><p>At <strong>Tier 5</strong> you choose your subclass, gain all three signatures, and pick an opening heroic. Every Tier after, you gain a new heroic ability and your Resonance cap rises. The ladder caps at <strong>Tier 1</strong>.</p>",
      "director": ""
    },
